# .editorconfig asks editors for LF; git does not read .editorconfig, so a
# clone with core.autocrlf=true would rewrite every line of the userscript to
# CRLF and produce a whole-file diff. This is the rule that actually binds.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Executable fixtures: the mode matters, the suite fails without it.
test/run.sh            text eol=lf
test/fakebin/tesseract text eol=lf
